  "findings": [
    {
      "level": "warn",
      "id": "screenshot-not-image",
      "lines": [
        "A screenshot of appinfo/info.xml is not served as an image:",
        "  <screenshot> https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LibreSign/libresign/main/img/screenshot/presentation.gif: application/octet-stream",
        "  The App Store shows the bytes behind the URL, so it needs the image itself; a github.com/.../blob/... URL is the page around it, raw.githubusercontent.com serves the file."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "warn",
      "id": "runtime-dirs-not-shipped",
      "lines": [
        "3rdparty/ is read at run time and is not in the shipped file set: lib/Service/SignatureTextService.php:273 reaches it through __DIR__, as 1 further place does.",
        "tests/ is read at run time and is not in the shipped file set: lib/Controller/DevelopController.php:51 reaches it through __DIR__.",
        "  A release ships only the paths of the keep set, so the tarball lacks them and the app fails in the code that reads them, while the build and the packing pass. In ncmake.mk, keep_extra += 3rdparty tests ships them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "warn",
      "id": "license-drift",
      "lines": [
        "Licence agpl (appinfo/info.xml, package.json), LICENSES/ holds AGPL-3.0-or-later.txt, CC0-1.0.txt, MIT.txt, OFL-1.1.txt.",
        "  agpl in appinfo/info.xml is a deprecated App Store value, shown there as AGPLv3+, which is AGPL-3.0-or-later. With min-version 33 info.xml can state an SPDX id instead.",
        "  No SPDX id: agpl (package.json). Only an SPDX id says which licence is meant, and for a GNU licence whether -only or -or-later."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "info",
      "id": "node-version",
      "lines": [
        "Node stated as ^24.0.0 (package.json engines.node).",
        "  Not stated in .nvmrc, so nothing keeps the other places from drifting away from it.",
        "  The workflows read node-version from a variable, which is not resolved here, so whether CI builds on that major is not decidable from the checkout."
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": "info",
      "id": "unreferenced-dependencies",
      "lines": [
        "8 declared packages are named nowhere in the checkout: @codemirror/lang-html, @nextcloud/paths, @vuelidate/core, @vuelidate/validators, @vueuse/integrations, sortablejs, @testing-library/dom, vite-plugin-node-polyfills.",
        "  Searched as literal names over 3,170 files, package.json excluded apart from its non-dependency fields, lockfiles excluded; then as an ESLint shorthand, as what TypeScript takes from a tsconfig, and as a peer of an installed package in package-lock.json. A package loaded some other way is not named anywhere either, so this is a list to check, not a list to remove."
